<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-05-05T21:23:51.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "testlesson-add-text-panels-53656722-c2bb-4bcc-be5d-78eed02d383e",
        "text": "Creating a web page is like casting a spell, but with HTML! Let's get Harry's first rave online.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/12d1511086a2cfbd88a30f8569db35dc-testlesson-add-text-panels-panel-1-68a4fc47-15ad-4e20-ba32-15ac303f461e.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "testlesson-add-text-panels-1ae7820f-8b7b-4c3e-b2ca-c07f06b45ab0",
        "text": "First, every great rave needs a **big, bold title!** Use the `<h1>` tag to make your main heading stand out.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c48ab73b33425fb3f8b3fb1b449d4046-testlesson-add-text-panels-panel-2-be5ff987-d252-4f28-879a-923c4d5c9096.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "testlesson-add-text-panels-c7ebaade-6aba-45ba-bf85-aec4cd7fc7e1",
        "text": "Next, organize your rave details with subheadings. `<h2>` tags are perfect for sections like 'What to Expect' or 'Music Lineup'.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/ff99ca765a69e2c2e655fcacf107219d-testlesson-add-text-panels-panel-3-6dd29a77-1877-4d98-b771-bb9ff0abbba2.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "testlesson-add-text-panels-31f78f4d-2fcb-4eb1-b357-bd1c4006766e",
        "text": "Finally, use the `<p>` tag for all your regular paragraphs. This is where you describe the *epic* details of the rave!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c63f9c192264e1a110b9414dbf195e79-testlesson-add-text-panels-panel-4-f11c5f44-4834-476f-b864-9bfdebfd327d.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "testlesson-add-text-panels-149fef4d-acbd-4586-b56f-fcb926beb732",
        "text": "And just like that, your awesome rave page is starting to take shape! `<h1>`, `<h2>`, and `<p>` are your basic building blocks.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/5574841cefa51a6edd03596e20f81c49-testlesson-add-text-panels-panel-5-e2412fb9-510f-44c1-af9a-1a425a82bc5a.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Explain how to add visible text content to a web page using HTML. Introduce common tags like <h1>, <h2>, and <p> for headings and paragraphs. Provide examples of how to structure information about a rave."
  },
  "published": true,
